    <detaileddescription>
<para>CHF Libor Swap indexes fixed by ISDA in cooperation with Reuters and Intercapital Brokers at 11am London. Annual 30/360 vs 6M <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_libor" kindref="compound">Libor</ref>, 1Y vs 3M <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_libor" kindref="compound">Libor</ref>. Reuters page ISDAFIX4 or CHFSFIX=.</para><para>Further info can be found at <ulink url="http://www.isda.org/fix/isdafix.html">http://www.isda.org/fix/isdafix.html</ulink> or Reuters page ISDAFIX. </para>    </detaileddescription>
